      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-08-17T20:15:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have these in the function because their values need to persist into the next call. But using the NESN would be a clever way of doing it. Do you think it\u0027s more clear to do that? I don\u0027t think it is, but I wrote this code so I\u0027m not the most objective.",
