        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-08-17T19:32:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Function headers please? :) Also, do you anticipate these functions being used outside this file? If not, let\u0027s not export them. Otherwise, place these declarations in a header file.",
      "revId": "4c26b24e91797e07c97e85ec8b12c91bc04aa31f",
