        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-08-17T19:43:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, just add \u0027static\u0027 to the functions. And by headers, I just mean some documentation for the function.\n\n    \n/**\n * Checks whether packet rx\u0027d is the same as the last rx\u0027d.\n *\n * @param packet ...\n */\nstatic uint8_t is_repeated_packet(struct ble_pdu *packet)",
      "parentUuid": "bb944b51_bb8a730f",
      "revId": "4c26b24e91797e07c97e85ec8b12c91bc04aa31f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
